    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Cantrip.</strong> You learn the Resistance cantrip. Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for it (choose when you take this feat).</p><p>You can cast the Resistance cantrip as a Bonus Action a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><p><strong>Sheltering Aid.</strong> When you take the Help action to assist an ally’s ability check, that ally gains a number of Temporary Hit Points equal to your Proficiency Bonus.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-e4GmhQhpiZVKF9OK\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Spend a use with <em>Bonus Action Casting</em> when you cast Resistance as a Bonus Action.</p></section>",
